@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L4：Kafka Provider 发送结果映射

participant KafkaMessageProvider as Provider
participant KafkaProducer as Producer
queue KafkaBroker as Broker
participant "ProviderSendResult" as Result

Provider -> Producer: send(ProducerRecord, callback)
Producer -> Broker: ProduceRequest

alt callback(metadata, null)
  Broker --> Producer: RecordMetadata
  Producer --> Provider: metadata(topic, partition, offset)
  Provider -> Result: CONFIRMED + providerMessageId=topic-partition@offset
else AuthorizationException / TopicAuthorizationException / SerializationException / RecordTooLargeException
  Producer --> Provider: exception
  Provider -> Result: REJECTED or FAILED + non-retryable failureType
else RetriableException / NetworkException / DisconnectException
  Producer --> Provider: exception
  Provider -> Result: FAILED + NETWORK_ERROR
else confirmTimeout waiting future
  Producer --x Provider: future not completed in time
  Provider -> Result: UNKNOWN + TIMEOUT
else unknown exception after request may have been sent
  Producer --> Provider: exception
  Provider -> Result: UNKNOWN + UNKNOWN_OUTCOME
end

note over Provider,Result
Kafka 客户端异常非常细，Provider 第一版先做保守映射：
明确参数/权限/序列化类问题不重试；网络类明确失败可重试；确认超时返回 UNKNOWN。
end note
@enduml
